{
	"uid": "know-orchestrator-worker",
	"title": "Know Orchestrator & Worker",
	"description": "Queue, worker activity, task rates, HTTP for Know orchestrator/worker",
	"tags": [
		"know",
		"orchestrator",
		"worker",
		"metrics"
	],
	"timezone": "browser",
	"schemaVersion": 39,
	"version": 1,
	"editable": true,
	"graphTooltip": 1,
	"time": {
		"from": "now-1h",
		"to": "now"
	},
	"timepicker": {},
	"templating": {
		"list": []
	},
	"panels": [
		{
			"id": 1,
			"type": "timeseries",
			"title": "Queue Depth",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 8,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 0
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "prometheus",
				"uid": "prom"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"expr": "sum by (kind) (orchestrator_queue_depth)",
					"legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
				}
			],
			"fieldConfig": {
				"defaults": {
					"unit": "short",
					"custom": {
						"fillOpacity": 15,
						"spanNulls": true
					}
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": 2,
			"type": "timeseries",
			"title": "Worker Active Tasks",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 8,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 12,
				"y": 0
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "prometheus",
				"uid": "prom"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"expr": "sum by (kind) (worker_active_tasks)",
					"legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
				}
			],
			"fieldConfig": {
				"defaults": {
					"unit": "short",
					"custom": {
						"fillOpacity": 15,
						"spanNulls": true
					}
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": 3,
			"type": "timeseries",
			"title": "Tasks Finished (rate)",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 8,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 8
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "prometheus",
				"uid": "prom"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"expr": "sum by (kind, status) (rate(worker_tasks_finished_total[5m]))",
					"legendFormat": "{{kind}} / {{status}}"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4,
			"type": "timeseries",
			"title": "Tasks Started (rate)",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 8,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 12,
				"y": 8
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "prometheus",
				"uid": "prom"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"expr": "sum by (kind, action) (rate(worker_tasks_started_total[5m]))",
					"legendFormat": "{{kind}} / {{action}}"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 5,
			"type": "timeseries",
			"title": "HTTP Request Rate (Orchestrator)",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 8,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 16
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "prometheus",
				"uid": "prom"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
					"legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 6,
			"type": "timeseries",
			"title": "HTTP p95 Latency",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 8,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 12,
				"y": 16
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "prometheus",
				"uid": "prom"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
					"legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
				}
			],
			"fieldConfig": {
				"defaults": {
					"unit": "s"
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": 7,
			"type": "timeseries",
			"title": "Task error ratio",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 8,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 24
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "prometheus",
				"uid": "prom"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"expr": "sum(rate(worker_tasks_finished_total{status=~\"error|killed|interrupted\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(worker_tasks_finished_total[5m])), 1e-9)",
					"legendFormat": "error ratio"
				}
			],
			"fieldConfig": {
				"defaults": {
					"unit": "percentunit",
					"min": 0,
					"max": 1,
					"custom": {
						"fillOpacity": 15
					}
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": 8,
			"type": "timeseries",
			"title": "Reindex progress & coverage",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 8,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 12,
				"y": 24
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "prometheus",
				"uid": "prom"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"expr": "reindex_progress_ratio",
					"legendFormat": "progress"
				},
				{
					"refId": "B",
					"expr": "reindex_current_coverage",
					"legendFormat": "coverage"
				}
			],
			"fieldConfig": {
				"defaults": {
					"unit": "percentunit",
					"min": 0,
					"max": 1
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": 9,
			"type": "timeseries",
			"title": "Reindex duration p95",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 8,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 0,
				"y": 32
			},
			"datasource": {
				"type": "prometheus",
				"uid": "prom"
			},
			"targets": [
				{
					"refId": "A",
					"expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(reindex_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
					"legendFormat": "p95"
				}
			],
			"fieldConfig": {
				"defaults": {
					"unit": "s"
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": 10,
			"type": "text",
			"title": "Runbook queries",
			"gridPos": {
				"h": 10,
				"w": 12,
				"x": 12,
				"y": 32
			},
			"options": {
				"mode": "markdown",
				"content": "## Prometheus\n```\nsum by (kind) (orchestrator_queue_depth)\nsum by (kind, status) (rate(worker_tasks_finished_total[5m]))\nsum(rate(worker_tasks_finished_total{status=~\"error|killed|interrupted\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(worker_tasks_finished_total[5m])), 1e-9)\nreindex_progress_ratio\nreindex_current_coverage\n```\n\n## Loki\n```\n{service_name=\"worker\"} | json | event=\"task_finished\" | status!=\"done\"\n{service_name=\"reindex\"} | json | level=~\"(?i)error\"\n{service_name=~\".+\"} | json | task_id=\"PASTE\"\n```\n\n## Tempo\nSearch tags: `service.name=worker`, `task.id=...`, `task.final_status=error`"
			}
		}
	]
}